\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Increases the Level of <a href=\"/wiki/Presto:_Bluebird_Finale\" title=\"Presto: Bluebird Finale\">Presto: Bluebird Finale</a> by 3.<br />Maximum upgrade level is 15.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Level_Increase\" title=\"Talent Level Increase\">Talent Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Burst_Level_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Burst Level Increase\">Elemental Burst Level Increase</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>\"Oh! I Have Slipped the Surly Bonds of Earth\"</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_5_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 5 Constellation\">Level 5 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522Oh%21_I_Have_Slipped_the_Surly_Bonds_of_Earth%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The name of her Level 5 Constellation is a reference to the opening line of the sonnet <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_Flight\"><i>High Flight</i></a> by World War II fighter pilot and war-poet <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Gillespie_Magee_Jr.\">John Gillespie Magee Jr.</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522Oh%21_I_Have_Slipped_the_Surly_Bonds_of_Earth%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>\"Oh! I Have Slipped the Surly Bonds of Earth\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">「看呀，我已告别尘与土的苦痛」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Kàn yā, Wǒ Yǐ Gàobié Chén yǔ Tǔ de Kǔtòng\"</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">\"O See, I Have Bidden Farewell With Sufferings of Dust And Earth\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「看呀，我已告別塵與土的苦痛」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Kàn yā, Wǒ Yǐ Gàobié Chén yǔ Tǔ de Kǔtòng\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「見よ&#8212;&#8212;塵と土の 痛みと別れる時を」</span><br /><small><i>\"Miyo⸺Chiri to Tsuchi no Itami to Wakareru Toki wo\"</i></small></td><td>\"O See — The Moment to Become Apart From Pain of Dust And Earth\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">「보아라</span> <span lang=\"ko\">나는</span> <span lang=\"ko\">지상의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">고통과</span> <span lang=\"ko\">작별했으니」</span><br /><small><i>\"Boara Naneun Jisang'ui Gotonggwa Jakbyeolhaesseuni\"</i></small></td><td>\"Look, I Have Said Farewell to the Pain on Earth\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td><span lang=\"es\">“</span>Observa, pues ya me he liberado del sufrimiento mundano<span lang=\"es\">”</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">«</span>&#160;Voici, car j'ai dit adieu aux souffrances terrestres&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">»</span></td><td>\"Here, For I Have Bidden Farewell to Earthly Sufferings\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">«Взгляни</span> -<wbr /> <span lang=\"ru\">я</span> <span lang=\"ru\">простилась</span> <span lang=\"ru\">с</span> <span lang=\"ru\">мирскими</span> <span lang=\"ru\">муками»</span><br /><small><i>\"Vzglyani - ya prostilas' s mirskimi mukami\"</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>\"Oh! I Have Slipped the Surly Bonds of Earth\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">\"Xem Kìa, Ta Đã Tạm Biệt Nỗi Đau Của Bụi Và Đất\"</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td><span lang=\"de\">„</span>Seht, denn ich habe mich vom irdischen Leiden verabschiedet<span lang=\"de\">“</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>\"Oh! I Have Slipped the Surly Bonds of Earth\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>\"Veja, Me Despedi do Sofrimento Terreno\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>\"Heyhat! Yery<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>z<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>n<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>n Ac<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>mas<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>z Ba<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>lar<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>ndan S<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>yr<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>ld<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>m\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>\"Ah! Sono libera dai torvi legami della terra\"</td><td>\"Ah! I am Free From the Grim Bonds of the Earth\"</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522Oh%21_I_Have_Slipped_the_Surly_Bonds_of_Earth%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/7.0\" title=\"Version/7.0\">Version 7.0</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/%22Oh!_I_Have_Slipped_the_Surly_Bonds_of_Earth%22/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=7.0&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Oh%21+I+Have+Slipped+the+Surly+Bonds+of+Earth%22\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\